<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ vehicle registrations rise in January, yr/yr.</title>
<headline>NZ vehicle registrations rise in January, yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand was 20,272 in January, lower than the December figure of 21,113 but up from 18,665 in January 1996, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>New and ex-overseas registrations totalled 18,368, compared with 18,469 last month and 16,850 in January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
